# Jmix Views Rules (Cursor)

## Scope
Applies to `src/main/java/**/view/` and `src/main/resources/**/view/`

## Patterns (List)
- Java: `StandardListView<Entity>`
- XML: data containers + dataLoadCoordinator
- Actions: create/edit/remove
- Menu entry in `menu.xml`
- Messages for titles/labels

## Patterns (Detail)
- Java: `StandardDetailView<Entity>`
- XML: `instance` container, form fields, save/close actions
- Validators in controller (`@Subscribe` events)

## Components
- Use `@ViewComponent` for UI injection
- Use `@Subscribe` for events
- Use data containers for binding

## Forbidden
- Business logic in controllers (keep in services)
- EntityManager usage
- Transactions in views
